        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: William Calley, veteran federal judge\n- Events: trial, ruling, release\n- Topics: pre-trial publicity, prejudice\n\nFacts:\n- William Calley was found guilty of killing 22 villagers.\n- William Calley was originally given a life sentence.\n- A veteran federal judge ruled that William Calley’s trial had been prejudiced by pre-trial publicity.\n- William Calley was released after the veteran federal judge’s ruling.",
